## 10. Expert Cache: Per-Layer Admission Slot Range

**Component:** `include/strata/core/expert_cache.hpp` — `layer_slot_range()`

**Responsibilities:** With per-layer admission, layer `l` may only use slots `[l*q, (l+1)*q)` where `q = slots()/n_layers`.

**Change:** The last layer takes the remainder, but `layer_slot_range` is declared without a definition in the header. Provide an inline implementation so the test can check it without linking the full engine.

```diff
--- a/include/strata/core/expert_cache.hpp
+++ b/include/strata/core/expert_cache.hpp
@@ -82,6 +82,14 @@ public:
     void set_per_layer_admission(bool on) { per_layer_ = on; }
     bool per_layer_admission() const { return per_layer_; }
     /// The slot range layer `l` may admit into under per-layer admission.  Exposed so a test can check it.
-    void layer_slot_range(int64_t layer, int64_t& lo, int64_t& hi) const;
+    void layer_slot_range(int64_t layer, int64_t& lo, int64_t& hi) const {
+        if (!per_layer_ || n_layers_ <= 0) { lo = 0; hi = slots_; return; }
+        const int64_t q = slots_ / n_layers_;
+        lo = layer * q;
+        hi = (layer + 1
